WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.801 --> 00:00:15.721
"This is bad," Detective Smith said.

2
00:00:15.722 --> 00:00:18.661
"People all over the city are trapped in their houses.

3
00:00:18.662 --> 00:00:22.179
We'll go to Brenda and Dan Dooley's house first. They live at . . ."

4
00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:26.539
"Ten Puddle Lane!" Roxy took off.

5
00:00:26.539 --> 00:00:30.350
Detective Smith groaned. "Rocket Girl never—"

6
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.612
A police officer ran in. "Our police cars were stolen!"

7
00:00:34.612 --> 00:00:43.542
The detective groaned again.

8
00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:54.737
No one answered the Dooleys' door, so Roxy entered the house. "Hello?"

9
00:00:54.737 --> 00:00:57.383
Click! The floor moved.

10
00:00:57.384 --> 00:00:58.865
Roxy jumped up.

11
00:00:58.866 --> 00:01:02.013
Ba-doom! The floor opened.

12
00:01:02.013 --> 00:01:04.867
Roxy flew down.

13
00:01:04.868 --> 00:01:09.063
"Rocket Girl, thank goodness!" Mr. Dooley said.

14
00:01:09.063 --> 00:01:12.247
"Our phones can't get a signal down here."

15
00:01:12.248 --> 00:01:15.173
Roxy carried the couple out of the dark room.

16
00:01:15.174 --> 00:01:19.502
Mrs. Dooley gasped as they flew through the house.

17
00:01:19.503 --> 00:01:22.210
"Where's our furniture?"

18
00:01:22.210 --> 00:01:26.372
"Our TV is gone!" Mr. Dooley cried.

19
00:01:26.373 --> 00:01:28.507
Roxy brought them to the front yard.

20
00:01:28.508 --> 00:01:31.452
"How long were you trapped down there?"

21
00:01:31.453 --> 00:01:34.513
"Since yesterday," Mr. Dooley said.

22
00:01:34.514 --> 00:01:37.427
"Our builder finished working on the house.

23
00:01:37.428 --> 00:01:39.913
He told us to take a look.

24
00:01:39.914 --> 00:01:42.042
Everything looked awful.

25
00:01:42.042 --> 00:01:48.669
Then the floor opened up, and we slid down into that room."

26
00:01:48.669 --> 00:01:51.426
"Who was the builder?" Roxy asked.

27
00:01:51.426 --> 00:01:55.531
"His name is Jack Hammer," Mrs. Dooley said.

28
00:01:55.532 --> 00:01:57.233
Mr. Dooley frowned.

29
00:01:57.234 --> 00:01:59.005
"We won't hire him again.

30
00:01:59.006 --> 00:02:02.662
I'm going to give him a bad online review too!"

31
00:02:02.663 --> 00:02:06.444
"Jack Hammer trapped other people," Roxy said.

32
00:02:06.444 --> 00:02:09.153
"I have to stop him!"

33
00:02:09.154 --> 00:02:12.453
Mr. Dooley looked up Jack Hammer on his phone.

34
00:02:12.454 --> 00:02:15.008
He gave the builder's address to Roxy.

35
00:02:15.009 --> 00:02:17.158
Roxy arrived at the office.

36
00:02:17.159 --> 00:02:21.661
It was in an old factory.

37
00:02:21.662 --> 00:02:24.036
A big man sat behind a desk.

38
00:02:24.036 --> 00:02:27.292
He wore overalls and a hard hat.

39
00:02:27.292 --> 00:02:30.446
"Jack Hammer!" Roxy shouted.

40
00:02:30.446 --> 00:02:34.241
The man stood up. "Hello, Rocket Girl."

41
00:02:34.241 --> 00:02:39.102
Roxy frowned. "Why are you trapping people in their houses?"

42
00:02:39.103 --> 00:02:44.050
Jack snorted. "Why do you think? I want to steal stuff.

43
00:02:44.051 --> 00:02:46.311
And it's not just houses.

44
00:02:46.312 --> 00:02:50.469
Recently, I worked on police headquarters and a school."

45
00:02:50.469 --> 00:02:54.959
Roxy narrowed her eyes. "What school?"

46
00:02:54.960 --> 00:03:00.094
"Metro City Elementary." Jack Hammer looked at his watch.

47
00:03:00.095 --> 00:03:04.326
"In fact, I should probably head over there now."

48
00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:07.384
"Grr!" Roxy rushed toward the villain.

49
00:03:07.385 --> 00:03:09.329
He stepped quickly through a door.

50
00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:13.581
Roxy burst through and found herself in a large, empty room.

51
00:03:13.581 --> 00:03:20.508
"Huh?" The room spun, and Roxy was thrown against a wall. "Oof!"

52
00:03:20.509 --> 00:03:29.265
When the room stopped spinning, Roxy ran through another door.

53
00:03:29.266 --> 00:03:31.084
Mirrors surrounded her.

54
00:03:31.085 --> 00:03:33.711
Her reflection was everywhere.

55
00:03:33.712 --> 00:03:38.244
Roxy gulped. "I'm stuck in an evil fun house!"

56
00:03:38.245 --> 00:03:42.833
She heard Jack Hammer laugh.

57
00:03:42.833 --> 00:03:47.730
"You'll never get out, Rocket Girl!"
